# cursor-study agent guidance

- This repo teaches Cursor features. Prefer explaining *which Cursor surface* to use (Tab, Cmd-K, Debug mode, Browser, Hook, etc.) when helping with exercises.
- Do not expand `playground/` into a full product; keep demos tiny.
- Never commit secrets. Point users to local MCP / env configs instead.
- When an exercise has acceptance criteria, verify against those criteria before claiming done.
